1.3; the flow is one-dimensional,

29
00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:02.455
steady and adiabatic in ducts, and
isentropic only where explicitly stated.

30
00:02:02.505 --> 00:02:06.996
The equation of state is P equals
rho R T, with R equal to c p times

31
00:02:07.036 --> 00:02:12.051
gamma minus one over gamma, and mass
conservation is rho v A constant.

32
00:02:12.101 --> 00:02:16.334
The first law balances heat and work
